# Byte-exact storage for the whole repository.
#
# vendor/frontend-kit/<version>/ is verified before import against the accepted
# backend delivery in delivery/ (src/host/kit.mjs), and delivery/ itself is
# pinned by SHA-256. Any end-of-line conversion on checkout - for example
# core.autocrlf=true on another machine - would silently change those bytes and
# the application would refuse to start its connection. Nothing here is
# normalised.
* -text
